{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Global Domination \u2013 Ball-Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is divided, and it's up to you to redraw the map. Step into the round shoes of your favorite Countryball and embark on the ultimate mission: conquer and unify all 195 countries. Whether through brute force or slick diplomacy, it's time to roll your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Income Per Second \u2013 Build Your Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i>, time is literally money. Your income grows every second. Upgrade your industries, boost trade, and manage global assets to fuel your expansion. The more countries you control, the more your economy explodes. Smart decisions lead to total domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f War or Influence \u2013 You Decide</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s more than one way to rule the world:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Conquer with Force</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/fa54ce6024e80946f1eff2695f1dd3a8.poster.avif?t=1763735878\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/fa54ce6024e80946f1eff2695f1dd3a8.webm?t=1763735878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/fa54ce6024e80946f1eff2695f1dd3a8.mp4?t=1763735878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train cartoony armies, deploy tanks, jets, submarines, and missile systems\u2014and when diplomacy fails, drop the nukes. Dominate the battlefield with over-the-top firepower, all wrapped in classic Countryball humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Control with Influence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spread your faith across borders and watch nations fall under your spiritual charm. Use religion as a tool of power\u2014win hearts, shift ideologies, and unify the world without firing a single shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Your Goal: Total World Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/2b8c98ab77af3dc1959901b3f30ed0f1.poster.avif?t=1763735878\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/2b8c98ab77af3dc1959901b3f30ed0f1.webm?t=1763735878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/2b8c98ab77af3dc1959901b3f30ed0f1.mp4?t=1763735878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No peace treaties. No second chances. Only one Countryball can become the supreme global ruler. Will you win by fear, friendship, or sheer strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude02 A Strategy Game That Doesn\u2019t Take Itself Too Seriously</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i> blends grand strategy with idle mechanics, packed with humor, history, and global absurdity. It's world conquest where even the smallest Countryball can redraw the map\u2014with enough upgrades and audacity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control over 195 unique Countryballs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your real-time income and economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance war, influence, and diplomacy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Countryball has a distinct look and national personality\u2014no customization needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh (or cry) as global events spiral into madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for strategy fans and meme lovers alike</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Add <i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i> to your Wishlist and get ready to take over the world\u2014diplomacy optional!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3780060/cb5b11627fbe406af1270d7e45133d2e9d624bbc.jpg"},{"name":"Tactical Expansion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3780060/6fdfa652646eab6282e96989f3f0b9c011b1d942.jpg"},{"name":"Sphere of Influence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3780060/fb86e8f0ce2ed42f93da5e2d251c5e37055087fe.jpg"},{"name":"Global Aspirations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3780060/7eb51687484b768947ff0389245faceb69d653cb.jpg"},{"name":"Hegemony Rising","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3780060/5f3e4cbd24928e41f3b77912ea48d5295c6bee40.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Planet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3780060/856e25c46b48e37c3077678def83bc0af134f7ca.jpg"},{"name":"Supreme Authority","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3780060/8e575928fe406fa6551df080c38038b63a3a219b.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3780060/06a1f2ddb5786a889484110105c3ed90c5c61322.jpg"},{"name":"First Deal","path":"https://cdn.akama