here\u2019s more than one way to rule the world:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Conquer with Force</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/fa54ce6024e80946f1eff2695f1dd3a8.poster.avif?t=1763735878\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/fa54ce6024e80946f1eff2695f1dd3a8.webm?t=1763735878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/fa54ce6024e80946f1eff2695f1dd3a8.mp4?t=1763735878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train cartoony armies, deploy tanks, jets, submarines, and missile systems\u2014and when diplomacy fails, drop the nukes. Dominate the battlefield with over-the-top firepower, all wrapped in classic Countryball humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Control with Influence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spread your faith across borders and watch nations fall under your spiritual charm. Use religion as a tool of power\u2014win hearts, shift ideologies, and unify the world without firing a single shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Your Goal: Total World Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/2b8c98ab77af3dc1959901b3f30ed0f1.poster.avif?t=1763735878\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/2b8c98ab77af3dc1959901b3f30ed0f1.webm?t=1763735878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/extras/2b8c98ab77af3dc1959901b3f30ed0f1.mp4?t=1763735878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No peace treaties. No second chances. Only one Countryball can become the supreme global ruler. Will you win by fear, friendship, or sheer strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude02 A Strategy Game That Doesn\u2019t Take Itself Too Seriously</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i> blends grand strategy with idle mechanics, packed with humor, history, and global absurdity. It's world conquest where even the smallest Countryball can redraw the map\u2014with enough upgrades and audacity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control over 195 unique Countryballs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your real-time income and economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance war, influence, and diplomacy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Countryball has a distinct look and national personality\u2014no customization needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh (or cry) as global events spiral into madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for strategy fans and meme lovers alike</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Add <i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i> to your Wishlist and get ready to take over the world\u2014diplomacy optional!</p>","developers":["KNK DEVELOP"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass